  "details": "[ Flying for Video Creators ] \nNot sure if this has been said or not, but i make Videos for avatar creators and when i was able to fly around i could get nice camera angles which made it super nice for making videos. wondering if we would be able to get the ability to fly for our creators ?\ni know some people will fly around for the fun of it so maybe you could implement it within the camera somehow? just throwing out thoughts here, being able to position myself in certain angles or to be able to slowly move in and out with the camera made very unique angles i could use within videos. Not having the ability to do so will make it difficult to get these specific angles.\nNow i've tried to use playspace mover but you cant do a full circle around them while doing so and it doesn't look as smooth, plus you cant go in and out smoothly either. you might accidently raise or lower yourself within the shot. Moving your play space to record DOES NOT WORK. it works if you make cuts every 3 seconds sure, but i do recordings. i direct and record so i get them to do specific moves while making these videos. play space mover does not help. having flight would be an AMAZING feature.",
